              "explanation": "noi → andiamo — the noi-form keeps the full stem 'and-'. Only io/tu/lui/loro change to vad-/va-.",
              "dictionaryRefs": [
                "andare",
                "il-bar"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "u7l2e3",
              "type": "fill_blank",
              "prompt": "Complete with venire.",
              "sentence": "Marco ___ da Roma.",
              "answers": [
                "viene"
              ],
              "explanation": "lui → viene. 'Venire da' + city = to come from / be from: 'Marco viene da Roma' = Marco is from Rome.",
              "dictionaryRefs": [
                "venire"
              ]
            },
